      "title": "Nadia's week",
      "lines": [
        {
          "bn": "আমি গত সপ্তাহে ঢাকায় এলাম।",
          "tr": "ami goto shoptahe dhakay elam.",
          "en": "I came to Dhaka last week."
        },
        {
          "bn": "এখন আমি বন্ধুর বাসায় থাকি।",
          "tr": "ekhon ami bondhur bashay thaki.",
          "en": "Now I'm staying at a friend's."
        },
        {
          "bn": "প্রতিদিন সকালে আমি বাংলা পড়ি, আর বিকালে রাফির সাথে চা খাই।",
          "tr": "protidin shokale ami bangla pori, ar bikale rafir shathe cha khai.",
          "en": "Every morning I read Bengali, and in the afternoon I have tea with Rafi."
        },
        {
          "bn": "কাল আমি রাফির অফিসে গেলাম, কিন্তু ও ছিল না।",
          "tr": "kal ami rafir ofise gelam, kintu o chhilo na.",
          "en": "Yesterday I went to Rafi's office, but he wasn't there."
        },
        {
          "bn": "আমি এখনো সিলেটে যাইনি।",
          "tr": "ami ekhono shilete jaini.",
          "en": "I haven't been to Sylhet yet."
        },
        {
          "bn": "সামনের মাসে আমরা সবাই সিলেটে যাব।",
          "tr": "shamner mashe amra shobai shilete jabo.",
          "en": "Next month we'll all go to Sylhet."
        }
      ],
      "question": "Where does Nadia live now?",
      "options": [
        "In Sylhet",
        "At a friend's",
        "At Rafi's"
      ],
      "answer": 1
    },
